<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="da">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FHIR Henvisning — Use Case Oversigt</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:ital,wght@0;300;0,400;0,600;1,300&display=swap');

  :root {
    --c-bg:        #F2F4F7;
    --c-surface:   #FFFFFF;
    --c-sidebar:   #1B2333;
    --c-sidebar-h: #243044;
    --c-teal:      #1A7F8E;
    --c-teal-lt:   #E6F4F6;
    --c-purple:    #4B3F8A;
    --c-purple-lt: #EEEAF7;
    --c-coral:     #C75D3A;
    --c-coral-lt:  #FBF0EB;
    --c-slate:     #3D4E63;
    --c-muted:     #7A8999;
    --c-border:    #D8DFE8;
    --c-text:      #1B2333;
    --radius:      10px;
    --mono:        'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    --sans:        'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    background: var(--c-bg);
    color: var(--c-text);
    display: flex;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* ── SIDEBAR ── */
  nav {
    width: 240px;
    min-width: 240px;
    background: var(--c-sidebar);
    color: #CBD5E1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 0 0 24px;
  }
  nav .nav-brand {
    padding: 24px 20px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2D3F57;
  }
  nav .nav-brand .wordmark {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--c-teal);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  nav .nav-brand h1 {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #E8EEF5;
    margin-top: 6px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  nav .nav-section {
    padding: 16px 20px 4px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #506070;
  }
  nav a {
    display: block;
    padding: 7px 20px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #9BAFC4;
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 1.4;
    transition: background 0.12s, color 0.12s;
  }
  nav a:hover, nav a.active {
    background: var(--c-sidebar-h);
    color: #E0EAF5;
  }
  nav a .uc-id {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--c-teal);
    margin-right: 6px;
  }

  /* ── MAIN ── */
  main {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 40px 48px 80px;
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--c-border);
  }
  .page-header .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--c-teal);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--c-slate);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .page-header h1 strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--c-text); }
  .page-header p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--c-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  /* ── SECTION HEADERS ── */
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 40px 0 20px;
  }
  .section-header .pill {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .pill-purple { background: var(--c-purple-lt); color: var(--c-purple); }
  .pill-teal   { background: var(--c-teal-lt);   color: var(--c-teal); }
  .pill-coral  { background: var(--c-coral-lt);  color: var(--c-coral); }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-slate);
  }
  .section-intro {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--c-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ── USE CASE CARD ── */
  .uc-card {
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .uc-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 20px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  }
  .uc-num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .num-purple { background: var(--c-purple-lt); color: var(--c-purple); }
  .num-teal   { background: var(--c-teal-lt);   color: var(--c-teal); }
  .num-coral  { background: var(--c-coral-lt);  color: var(--c-coral); }

  .uc-card-header h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-text);
  }
  .uc-body {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 260px;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .uc-left {}
  .uc-desc {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--c-slate);
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .uc-story {
    background: var(--c-bg);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c-border);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--c-slate);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .uc-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .meta-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--c-muted);
    min-width: 68px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .meta-val {
    color: var(--c-slate);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  code {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    background: var(--c-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--c-teal);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* next-step chips */
  .next-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .next-chip {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: opacity 0.1s;
  }
  .next-chip:hover { opacity: 0.75; }
  .chip-purple { background: var(--c-purple-lt); color: var(--c-purple); }
  .chip-teal   { background: var(--c-teal-lt);   color: var(--c-teal); }
  .chip-coral  { background: var(--c-coral-lt);  color: var(--c-coral); }
  .chip-end    { background: #F0F4F0; color: #4A7A4A; }

  /* ── DIAGRAM (right column) ── */
  .uc-diagram svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ── RESOURCE TABLE ── */
  .res-table-wrap {
    margin-top: 48px;
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .res-table-wrap h2 {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    color: var(--c-slate);
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  th {
    background: var(--c-bg);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--c-muted);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  }
  td {
    padding: 9px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF2F7;
    color: var(--c-slate);
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  tr:hover td { background: #FAFBFD; }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    nav { display: none; }
    main { padding: 24px 20px 60px; }
    .uc-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .uc-diagram { order: -1; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- SIDEBAR NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-brand">
    <div class="wordmark">FHIR · Refers</div>
    <h1>Use Case Oversigt</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="nav-section">Henviser</div>
  <a href="#uc-1-1"><span class="uc-id">1.1</span> Oprette henvisning</a>
  <a href="#uc-1-2"><span class="uc-id">1.2</span> Tilknytte dokumentation</a>
  <a href="#uc-1-3"><span class="uc-id">1.3</span> Ændre henvisning</a>
  <a href="#uc-1-4"><span class="uc-id">1.4</span> Tilbagekalde</a>
  <a href="#uc-1-5"><span class="uc-id">1.5</span> Monitorere status</a>
  <a href="#uc-1-6"><span class="uc-id">1.6</span> Modtage afgørelse</a>

  <div class="nav-section">Visitator</div>
  <a href="#uc-2-1"><span class="uc-id">2.1</span> Modtage og kvittere</a>
  <a href="#uc-2-2"><span class="uc-id">2.2</span> Triagere og prioritere</a>
  <a href="#uc-2-3"><span class="uc-id">2.3</span> Acceptere og booke</a>
  <a href="#uc-2-4"><span class="uc-id">2.4</span> Afvise</a>
  <a href="#uc-2-5"><span class="uc-id">2.5</span> Videresende</a>
  <a href="#uc-2-6"><span class="uc-id">2.6</span> Ændre prioritet</a>

  <div class="nav-section">Udvekslingsdialog</div>
  <a href="#uc-3-1"><span class="uc-id">3.1</span> Anmode om supplement</a>
  <a href="#uc-3-2"><span class="uc-id">3.2</span> Besvare supplement</a>
  <a href="#uc-3-3"><span class="uc-id">3.3</span> Faglig afklaring</a>
  <a href="#uc-3-4"><span class="uc-id">3.4</span> Statusnotifikation</a>
  <a href="#uc-3-5"><span class="uc-id">3.5</span> Alternativ visitation</a>
  <a href="#uc-3-6"><span class="uc-id">3.6</span> Korrektionsaftale</a>

  <div class="nav-section">Reference</div>
  <a href="#resource-table"><span class="uc-id">↓</span> Ressourceoversigt</a>
</nav>

<!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
<main>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="eyebrow">FHIR R4 · Henvisningsworkflow</div>
    <h1>Use Cases for <strong>FHIR-baseret</strong><br>Henvisningshåndtering</h1>
    <p>Oversigt over use cases for de to primære roller — <strong>henviseren</strong> og <strong>visitatoren</strong> — samt de fælles use cases der opstår i udvekslingsdialogen mellem dem. Al kommunikation foregår via FHIR-baserede beskeder.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
       SEKTION 1 — HENVISER
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="pill pill-purple">Sektion 1</span>
    <h2>Henviserens use cases</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="section-intro">Udføres selvstændigt af henviseren uden at kræve aktiv respons fra visitatoren ud over systemkvittering.</p>

  <!-- 1.1 -->
  <div class="uc-card" id="uc-1-1">
    <div class="uc-card-header">
      <span class="uc-num num-purple">1.1</span>
      <h3>Oprette en ny henvisning</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="uc-body">
      <div class="uc-left">
        <p class="uc-desc">Henviseren udfærdiger og afsender en ny henvisning til et modtagende tilbud. Henvisningen repræsenteres som en <code>ServiceRequest</code>-ressource med status <code>proposed</code> og sendes i en FHIR-<code>Bundle</code>. Henvisningen indeholder patientoplysninger, indikation, hastegrad og ønsket ydelse.</p>
        <p class="uc-story">Som henviser ønsker jeg at kunne oprette og afsende en struktureret henvisning via FHIR, når jeg har truffet en klinisk beslutning om at viderehenvise en patient, så visitatoren modtager alle nødvendige oplysninger på et standardiseret format.</p>
        <div class="uc-meta">
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Ressource</span><span class="meta-val"><code>ServiceRequest</code> status=proposed</span></div>
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Trigger</span><span class="meta-val">Klinisk beslutning om at henvise patient</span></div>
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Næste trin</span>
            <div class="next-steps">
              <a class="next-chip chip-purple" href="#uc-1-2">1.2 Tilknytte dok.</a>
              <a class="next-chip chip-teal" href="#uc-2-1">2.1 Modtage</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-diagram">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <!-- actor -->
          <circle cx="36" cy="30" r="10" fill="#EEEAF7" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="40" x2="36" y2="68" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="20" y1="52" x2="52" y2="52" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="68" x2="22" y2="84" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="68" x2="50" y2="84" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <text x="36" y="98" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#4B3F8A" font-weight="600">Henviser</text>
          <!-- arrow -->
          <line x1="68" y1="52" x2="120" y2="52" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrowP)"/>
          <!-- resource box -->
          <rect x="122" y="38" width="100" height="28" rx="6" fill="#EEEAF7" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="172" y="51" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace" font-size="9" fill="#4B3F8A" font-weight="600">ServiceRequest</text>
          <text x="172" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace" font-size="8" fill="#7060B0">proposed</text>
          <!-- label on arrow -->
          <text x="94" y="48" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif" font-size="8" fill="#7A8999">POST Bundle</text>
          <!-- destination -->
          <line x1="172" y1="66" x2="172" y2="108" stroke="#888" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/>
          <rect x="122" y="110" width="100" height="24" rx="6" fill="#E6F4F6" stroke="#1A7F8E" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="172" y="125" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#1A7F8E">→ 2.1 Modtage</text>
          <defs>
            <marker id="arrowP" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto">
              <path d="M1 1L7 4L1 7" fill="none" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            </marker>
          </defs>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 1.2 -->
  <div class="uc-card" id="uc-1-2">
    <div class="uc-card-header">
      <span class="uc-num num-purple">1.2</span>
      <h3>Tilknytte klinisk dokumentation</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="uc-body">
      <div class="uc-left">
        <p class="uc-desc">Henviseren vedhæfter supplerende klinisk materiale til en eksisterende henvisning — fx laboratoriesvar, billeddiagnostik eller tidligere epikriser. Materialet knyttes til <code>ServiceRequest</code>-ressourcen via referencer til <code>DiagnosticReport</code>, <code>Media</code> eller <code>DocumentReference</code>.</p>
        <p class="uc-story">Som henviser ønsker jeg at kunne vedhæfte relevant klinisk dokumentation til en eksisterende henvisning, når jeg vurderer at visitatoren har brug for supplerende materiale for at træffe en god afgørelse, så beslutningsgrundlaget er samlet ét sted.</p>
        <div class="uc-meta">
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Ressource</span><span class="meta-val"><code>DiagnosticReport</code> · <code>Media</code> · <code>DocumentReference</code></span></div>
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Trigger</span><span class="meta-val">Behov for at understøtte klinisk beslutningsgrundlag</span></div>
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Næste trin</span>
            <div class="next-steps">
              <a class="next-chip chip-teal" href="#uc-2-1">2.1 Modtage</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-diagram">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 150" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <defs>
            <marker id="arrowP2" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto">
              <path d="M1 1L7 4L1 7" fill="none" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            </marker>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="36" cy="28" r="10" fill="#EEEAF7" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="38" x2="36" y2="66" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="20" y1="50" x2="52" y2="50" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="66" x2="22" y2="82" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="66" x2="50" y2="82" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <text x="36" y="96" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#4B3F8A" font-weight="600">Henviser</text>
          <!-- existing SR -->
          <rect x="90" y="16" width="130" height="22" rx="5" fill="#F5F5F5" stroke="#B0B8C4" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/>
          <text x="155" y="31" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace" font-size="8" fill="#888">ServiceRequest (eksist.)</text>
          <!-- doc boxes -->
          <rect x="90" y="52" width="58" height="20" rx="5" fill="#EEEAF7" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="119" y="65" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#4B3F8A">DiagnosticRpt</text>
          <rect x="158" y="52" width="58" height="20" rx="5" fill="#EEEAF7" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="187" y="65" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#4B3F8A">Media / DocRef</text>
          <!-- attach arrows -->
          <line x1="119" y1="38" x2="119" y2="52" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#arrowP2)"/>
          <line x1="187" y1="38" x2="187" y2="52" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#arrowP2)"/>
          <line x1="68" y1="50" x2="88" y2="50" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrowP2)"/>
          <!-- next -->
          <rect x="90" y="90" width="130" height="22" rx="5" fill="#E6F4F6" stroke="#1A7F8E" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="155" y="104" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#1A7F8E">→ 2.1 Modtage</text>
          <line x1="155" y1="72" x2="155" y2="90" stroke="#888" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 1.3 -->
  <div class="uc-card" id="uc-1-3">
    <div class="uc-card-header">
      <span class="uc-num num-purple">1.3</span>
      <h3>Ændre en afsendt henvisning</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="uc-body">
      <div class="uc-left">
        <p class="uc-desc">Henviseren opdaterer indholdet af en allerede afsendt henvisning — fx korrigerer indikation, hastegrad eller kontaktoplysninger. Opdateringen sker via en <code>PUT</code>-operation på den eksisterende <code>ServiceRequest</code>, og der sættes et revisionsflag så visitatoren notificeres.</p>
        <p class="uc-story">Som henviser ønsker jeg at kunne rette indholdet i en allerede afsendt henvisning, når jeg opdager en fejl eller patientens kliniske situation ændrer sig, så visitatoren altid arbejder ud fra korrekte og aktuelle oplysninger.</p>
        <div class="uc-meta">
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Ressource</span><span class="meta-val"><code>ServiceRequest</code> (PUT / revision)</span></div>
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Trigger</span><span class="meta-val">Fejl opdaget eller klinisk situation ændret efter afsendelse</span></div>
          <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-label">Næste trin</span>
            <div class="next-steps">
              <a class="next-chip chip-teal" href="#uc-2-2">2.2 Triagere</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-diagram">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 140" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <defs>
            <marker id="arrowP3" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto">
              <path d="M1 1L7 4L1 7" fill="none" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            </marker>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="36" cy="28" r="10" fill="#EEEAF7" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="38" x2="36" y2="66" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="20" y1="50" x2="52" y2="50" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="66" x2="22" y2="82" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="36" y1="66" x2="50" y2="82" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <text x="36" y="96" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#4B3F8A" font-weight="600">Henviser</text>
          <line x1="68" y1="50" x2="118" y2="50" stroke="#4B3F8A" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrowP3)"/>
